#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
khaos-lab — central control panel for the arc toolkit.
Renamed twice 2026-08-26 (control panel -> khaos-panel -> khaos-klinik ->
khaos-lab), user's own call each time -- keep it simple stuck.

A lightweight GUI front-end over the `arc` CLI you already have. Every
button here shells out to the exact same `arc <subcommand>` (or a small,
well-understood handful of raw commands for live status) already built,
tested, and running on this machine -- this does not reimplement any
logic, it's a dashboard/launcher over what already works.

Manual-start only, same principle as arc-break/arc-pine/darkstat/zap --
no autostart entry, nothing brings this up on its own.

Layout: left sidebar picks a category, right side shows that category's
actions, bottom is a shared output console (every action's real stdout/
stderr lands there) plus a free-form command box for anything not
covered by a button.
"""

